{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "dd5deb68b70aa5c5d6a1dbf1", "title": "比特币一度跌破6.8万美元创三个月新低，加密货币概念股集体下跌", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-14/doc-iniyriiv3482393.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-14T00:17:11+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 81.7375, "list_rank": 4, "list_size": 194, "rank_percentile": 0.9845, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 0.0}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 0.0, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriiv3482393", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-niyriiv3482393"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-14T00:17:11+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-14", "crawled_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-14", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 18.04, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 31, "content_length": 420, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "11月13日，比特币价格一度下跌5.4%至67628.13美元，跌破7万美元关口，创今年8月以来最低水平。美国通胀压力持续、美联储加息预期升温，以及市场风险偏好下降，共同对加密货币市场形成压力，并拖累美股加密货币相关股票普遍下跌。 个股方面，比特币持仓公司Strategy下跌3.4%，加密货币交易平台Coinbase下跌2.6%，稳定币发行商 Circle Internet Group下跌2.9%，加密货币矿企MARA Holdings和Riot Platforms分别下跌5", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 4, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "11月13日，比特币价格一度下跌5.4%至67628.13美元，跌破7万美元关口，创今年8月以来最低水平。美国通胀压力持续、美联储加息预期升温，以及市场风险偏好下降，共同对加密货币市场形成压力，并拖累美股加密货币相关股票普遍下跌。 个股方面，比特币持仓公司Strategy下跌3.4%，加密货币交易平台Coinbase下跌2.6%，稳定币发行商 Circle Internet Group下跌2.9%，加密货币矿企MARA Holdings和Riot Platforms分别下跌5.0%和4.2%。此外，Robinhood Markets下跌4.5%，Galaxy Digital下跌4.9%，Bullish下跌4.3%。 Bitunix分析师Dean Chen表示，英伟达近期管理层变动及公司治理风波加剧了投资者对AI行业投资前景的担忧。这些变化可能进一步影响市场对利率、美元流动性及整体风险偏好的判断，进而对比特币等高风险资产形成压力。", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 4, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriiv3482393", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "