{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "54d611861325cd2c74288a7b", "title": "微软全球服务故障持续第二天，Outlook等服务逐步恢复但仍未完全修复", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-14/doc-iniyriiu7888846.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-14T00:13:58+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 81.377, "list_rank": 6, "list_size": 194, "rank_percentile": 0.9742, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 0.0}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 0.0, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriiu7888846", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-niyriiu7888846"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-14T00:13:58+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-14", "crawled_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-14", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 21.26, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 35, "content_length": 580, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "11月13日， 微软 表示，持续近两天的大规模服务故障正在逐步得到修复，Outlook邮箱及其他Microsoft 365服务的可用性和邮件投递表现已有改善，但部分用户仍可能遇到间歇性连接问题。此次故障始于周四下午，波及全球多地企业、政府机构及其他组织。 故障涉及Outlook、Teams、Copilot，以及Word、Excel、PowerPoint、SharePoint和OneDrive等多项微软服务。网络故障监测网站Downdetector周四下午记录到近13万起相关故", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 6, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "11月13日， 微软 表示，持续近两天的大规模服务故障正在逐步得到修复，Outlook邮箱及其他Microsoft 365服务的可用性和邮件投递表现已有改善，但部分用户仍可能遇到间歇性连接问题。此次故障始于周四下午，波及全球多地企业、政府机构及其他组织。 故障涉及Outlook、Teams、Copilot，以及Word、Excel、PowerPoint、SharePoint和OneDrive等多项微软服务。网络故障监测网站Downdetector周四下午记录到近13万起相关故障报告。美国巴尔的摩县、杰克逊维尔和奥斯汀等地方政府受到影响，英国部分政府部门及国民医疗服务体系（NHS）也出现通信中断。印度航空公司报告客户服务通信受阻，OpenAI和Anthropic同样出现与Microsoft 365服务连接有关的问题。 微软表示，故障主要涉及支撑Outlook邮件及日程服务的Exchange Online基础设施。部分服务器工作负载异常升高，另有服务器在自动检测过程中意外停止提供服务，导致用户连接受阻。公司正通过恢复服务器、重新分配流量及部署软件修复程序改善服务，并处理此前积压的延迟邮件。 目前，微软尚未确定故障的根本技术原因，但表示未发现此次事件由恶意活动或网络攻击引发的迹象。公司仍在持续恢复剩余受影响系统，尚未公布全部服务恢复正常的具体时间。", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 6, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 