，称其发展历程堪称本世纪最精彩商业故事之一，但因该公司估值受诸多难测变量影响、难以精准判定，不符合其低风险、高确定性的投资标准，不会在其上市初期买入。Anthropic拟11月19日于纳斯达克挂牌，代码ANT，IPO发行价区间70-78美元，完全稀释后目标估值约1.4万亿美元，价区上限对应最高募资1000亿美元。其三季度营收同比暴涨1127%至170亿美元，但环比增速较前两季度明显降温，当季巨亏232.9亿美元。", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 7, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "潘兴广场资本CEO比尔・阿克曼虽认可Anthropic的发展潜力，称其发展历程堪称本世纪最精彩商业故事之一，但因该公司估值受诸多难测变量影响、难以精准判定，不符合其低风险、高确定性的投资标准，不会在其上市初期买入。Anthropic拟11月19日于纳斯达克挂牌，代码ANT，IPO发行价区间70-78美元，完全稀释后目标估值约1.4万亿美元，价区上限对应最高募资1000亿美元。其三季度营收同比暴涨1127%至170亿美元，但环比增速较前两季度明显降温，当季巨亏232.9亿美元。(AI生成)", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 7, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriiv3480851", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-niyriiv3480851"}}}}, "diagnostics": {"content_hash": "c6520ebeede6ec75ec6e6fed2de159c436cc86234b9e823b415bdfef4bfda5ed", "title_hash": "10cff8cb3f018b751295e4cafa4a2a7