{"schema_version": "2.0", "record_type": "finance_news_article", "article_id": "85cb2a7fc27ce18410cc8213", "title": "英伟达风波持续发酵，AI产业链股票集体大跌，AMD跌超8%", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/usstock/c/2026-11-14/doc-iniyriit1108478.shtml", "source": "新浪财经", "source_id": "sina_finance", "source_tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-11-14T00:04:10+08:00", "crawled_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "status": "valid", "quality_score": 0.976, "quality_flags": [], "hotness": {"score": 80.656, "list_rank": 10, "list_size": 194, "rank_percentile": 0.9536, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "has_engagement_metrics": true, "engagement_score": 0.0}, "engagement": {"has_any_metric": true, "available_metrics": ["comment_count"], "missing_metrics": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "available_metric_count": 1, "counts": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null}, "score": 0.0, "metric_source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriit1108478", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-niyriit1108478"}}}, "source_info": {"id": "sina_finance", "name": "新浪财经", "tier": "T1", "role": "market_news", "priority": 6, "section": "滚动新闻"}, "time_info": {"published_at": "2026-11-14T00:04:10+08:00", "published_date": "2026-11-14", "crawled_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "crawl_date": "2026-11-14", "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai", "age_minutes_at_crawl": 31.06, "published_after_crawl": false}, "content_info": {"title_length": 29, "content_length": 412, "has_content": true, "excerpt": "11月13日，美股人工智能产业链股票普遍下跌，英伟达管理层变动及相关调查引发的市场担忧持续发酵，抛售压力从AI芯片制造商蔓延至半导体设备、光通信及其他AI基础设施企业。英伟达股价下跌3.35%， AMD 下跌8.53%，Marvell Technology下跌7.55%， 应用材料 下跌7.55%，博通下跌5.81%。 板块指数方面，费城半导体指数下跌4.5%，Solactive美国光通信网络指数下跌6%，标普半导体设备指数下跌5.2%。相关主题ETF同样承压，Roundhi", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 10, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "11月13日，美股人工智能产业链股票普遍下跌，英伟达管理层变动及相关调查引发的市场担忧持续发酵，抛售压力从AI芯片制造商蔓延至半导体设备、光通信及其他AI基础设施企业。英伟达股价下跌3.35%， AMD 下跌8.53%，Marvell Technology下跌7.55%， 应用材料 下跌7.55%，博通下跌5.81%。 板块指数方面，费城半导体指数下跌4.5%，Solactive美国光通信网络指数下跌6%，标普半导体设备指数下跌5.2%。相关主题ETF同样承压，Roundhill Memory ETF下跌5%，Invesco Solar ETF下跌2.8%，显示市场抛售已扩散至存储芯片及能源基础设施等AI相关投资领域。 此次下跌发生在英伟达前首席执行官黄仁勋因私人丑闻被罢免之后。随着事件引发美国国会关注，黄仁勋已同意赴国会作证。英伟达未来的管理战略及公司治理前景面临不确定性，进一步加剧了投资者对AI产业链的担忧。", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 10, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriit1108478", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-ni