变化框架公约》第三十一次缔约方大会（COP31）期间，联合国环境规划署金融倡议（UNEP FI）负责人埃里克·亚瑟（Eric Usher）在面向新浪财经时表示，提升金融部门气候韧性，不能仅依赖灾害发生后的保险赔付，更重要的是将金融和保险行业积累的气候风险评估能力用于灾害预防和适应性建设，从而减少气候灾害造成的实际损失。", "author": "新浪财经", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 11, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "专题：第31届联合国气候变化大会（COP31） 当地时间11月13日，在《联合国气候变化框架公约》第三十一次缔约方大会（COP31）期间，联合国环境规划署金融倡议（UNEP FI）负责人埃里克·亚瑟（Eric Usher）在面向新浪财经时表示，提升金融部门气候韧性，不能仅依赖灾害发生后的保险赔付，更重要的是将金融和保险行业积累的气候风险评估能力用于灾害预防和适应性建设，从而减少气候灾害造成的实际损失。", "author": "新浪财经", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 11, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-14T00:35:13.415096+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-niyriiu7883127", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-niyriiu7883127"}}}}, "diagnostics": {"content_hash": "bf89b2573a36197217e164860aa7e152aeb9508b6fdeeceb84d434e484e7c9e8", "title_hash": "904e05beb81ba7025bc309ecd2feac1e414f35a1a6cfe317803a07f98904b59d", "quality_flags": []}, "content_hash": "bf89b2573a36197217e